## Data & Matching Notes

| Entity | Matching Input | Algorithm |
|---|---|---|
| Tenant ↔ Listing | Budget, location, room type, move-in date | Cosine Similarity → Two-Tower NN |
| Tenant ↔ Tenant | Lifestyle prefs, sleep schedule, cleanliness, social habits | Cosine Similarity → Two-Tower NN |

**Like tracking for houses:**
- The system tracks which users from a tenant's **match list** have liked a given property.
- This "liked by X of your matches" counter is only surfaced within the match context (not globally).

